post-it: Visual artifacting
symptoms:
	Visual artifacting on screen
		shows: from the moment the computer starts, coloured blocks and torn lines flicker over the picture
		category: At startup
	GPU overheating
		shows: the GPU's heatsink is scorched in the Workview
		category: On the computer
hardware steps:
	Remove the computer shell
	Remove the GPU, throw it in the trash
	Get a new GPU from storage
	Install the GPU
	Remount the shell
